/-!
# A257489

Arrange numbers in a single clockwise spiral so that each number is relatively prime to its 12 nearest neighbors.

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A257489

/-- Known terms of `A257489`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 2, 3, 5, 4, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15,
    17, 19, 8, 23, 29, 27, 25, 31, 37, 10,
    41, 43, 14, 47, 53, 16, 49, 59, 55, 21,
